  "body": "The perfect time to secure your brand-new standalone home in a top school zone!\r\n\r\nOnly ONE 4-bedroom home remaining!\r\nEnjoy affordable, modern living with everything you looking for:\r\n\r\n* 4 bedrooms\r\n* 2.5 bathrooms, including a bathtub\r\n* Single internal-access garage\r\n* Plenty of convenient street parking right at your doorstep\r\n\r\nOr \r\n* 2 bedrooms\r\n* 1 large study room\r\n* 3.5 bathroom\r\n* Single internal-access garage\r\n\r\nExcellent school zones - a great choice for families!\r\nZoned for:\r\n\r\n* Sherwood Primary School\r\n* Northcross Intermediate\r\n* Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n* Rangitoto College\r\n* Long Bay College\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity, Come and meet Lawrance on-site, to explore the homes, discuss available options and find the one that best suits your needs.",
